	// (accumulated entirely in a local scalar), but:
	//   - we avoid computing for j < i by slicing j ∈ [i, M)
	//   - we accumulate into a local variable 'acc' instead of repeatedly
	//     reading/writing cov[i][j] inside the k-loop
